<00:00:00.143>My <00:00:00.252>landing <00:00:00.545>did <00:00:00.665>not <00:00:00.828>go <00:00:00.926>to <00:00:00.991>plan. <00:00:01.697>In <00:00:01.817>April <00:00:02.578>1967 <00:00:03.186>I <00:00:03.306>came <00:00:03.567>down <00:00:03.839>toward <00:00:04.045>the <00:00:04.143>Ocean <00:00:04.426>of <00:00:04.513>Storms, <00:00:05.263>and <00:00:05.349>my <00:00:05.502>engines <00:00:05.806>were <00:00:05.904>supposed <00:00:06.295>to <00:00:06.360>switch <00:00:06.676>off <00:00:07.078>just <00:00:07.284>above <00:00:07.513>the <00:00:07.578>ground. <00:00:08.328>They <00:00:08.393>didn't. <00:00:09.034>I <00:00:09.099>touched <00:00:09.404>down, <00:00:10.056>bounced <00:00:10.339>back <00:00:10.578>up, <00:00:10.980>touched <00:00:11.273>down, <00:00:11.926>bounced <00:00:12.219>again, <00:00:12.806>and <00:00:12.915>finally <00:00:13.328>settled <00:00:13.643>on <00:00:13.741>the <00:00:13.817>third <00:00:14.089>try. <00:00:14.795>I <00:00:14.882>ended <00:00:15.056>up <00:00:15.176>inside <00:00:15.469>a <00:00:15.513>crater.
